            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "background": "@cardbg",
              "padding": "2.25rem 2.25rem 1rem 2.25rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem 0.5rem 1.5rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1200px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem 0.5rem 1.5rem"
              }
            },
            ".main-button": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "padding-left": "2.25rem",
                "list-style": "none",
                "li": {
                  "position": "relative",
                  "list-style": "none",
                  "margin-bottom": "2rem",
                  "&:before": {
                    "position": "absolute",
                    "left": "-1.5em",
                    "content": "\"\"",
                    "display": "flex",
                    "justify-content": "center",
                    "align-items": "center",
                    "color": "@iconColor",
                    "background-color": "@iconColor",
                    "width": "0.5em",
                    "height": "0.5em",
                    "top": "0.4em",
                    "border-radius": "50%"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text UL": {
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article21",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article021\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\">\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#9fe870\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/photo-1495584816685-4bdbf1b5057e.jpeg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f7f7f7\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>💼 Who Is This For ?</b></h5>\n                    <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>You May Be Ready for This Work If...</b><br><div>You understand what you should do—but something within you still makes it difficult to change.</div><div><br></div><div>🔹You may be experiencing:<br><div>🔹Repeating emotional patterns</div></div><div>🔹Fear or self-doubt</div><div>🔹Lack of confidence</div><div>🔹Overthinking</div><div>🔹Difficulty letting go of the past</div><div>🔹Emotional heaviness</div><div>🔹Stress and overwhelm</div><div>🔹Relationship patterns</div><div>🔹Communication difficulties</div><div>🔹Lack of clarity or direction</div><div>🔹Performance or motivation blocks</div><div>🔹Difficulty changing unwanted habits</div><div>🔹Feeling disconnected from yourself</div><div>🔹A desire for deeper inner&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; transformation</div><div><br></div><div>You don't have to have everything figured out before you begin.</div><div><br></div><div>You simply need the willingness to explore.</div></h6>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                        <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            Learn more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                        <ul>\n                            <li><b>WHAT MAY BE HOLDING YOU BACK?</b></li></ul><div><b>🧠 MIND &amp; THOUGHTS</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Overthinking • Limiting beliefs • Self-doubt • Lack of clarity</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>❤️ EMOTIONS</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Emotional heaviness • Repeating emotional patterns • Difficulty letting go</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>🌙 SUBCONSCIOUS PATTERNS</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Unwanted habits • Automatic responses • Deeply learned patterns</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>🧲 PRESENCE &amp; MAGNETISM</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Confidence • Personal presence • Awareness • Self-expression</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>⚡ ENERGY &amp; WELLNESS</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Inner balance • Relaxation • Grounding • Energetic awareness</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>🌱 PERSONAL TRANSFORMATION</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Clarity • Confidence • Self-awareness • Meaningful change</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>If you've ever felt:</b></div><div><b>😔 </b>Stuck despite trying hard</div><div><b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">😰 Overwhelmed by your thoughts or emotions</span><br></b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">🤔 Lost or unclear about your direction</span><br></b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">💭 Held back by self-doubt, fear or old patterns</span><br></b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>❤️ </b>Carrying emotions you're ready to understand and release</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Then this journey may be for YOU. ✨</b></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
