          "_name": "article21",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article021\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\" checked>\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#9fe870\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/photo-1495584816685-4bdbf1b5057e.jpeg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f7f7f7\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>🧠 YOUR INNER WORLD SHAPES YOUR EXPERIENCE</b></h5>\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">What if the change you're looking for isn't only about changing what happens around you—<div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div><br></div><div>but also about understanding what happens within you?</div><div><br></div><div>Your thoughts.</div><div>Your beliefs.</div><div>Your emotions.</div><div>Your learned patterns.</div><div>Your responses.</div><div>Your energy and sense of inner balance.</div><div><br></div><div>Sometimes you know exactly what you want to change...</div><div><br></div><div>but something within you keeps returning to the same pattern.</div><div><br></div><div>That's where deeper work begins.</div><div><br></div><div>Not by forcing change.</div><div><br></div><div>But by understanding, exploring and transforming from within.</div><div><br></div><div>REWIRE • RELEASE • TRANSFORM</div></h4>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/rzp/YZQ6QlB\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            BEGIN YOUR TRANSFORMATION\n                        </a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                        <ul>\n                            <li><b>WELCOME TO PRAVEEN WORLD</b></li></ul><div>Praveen World brings together different approaches to support personal transformation through the<b> NLP, subconscious mind, emotions, presence and holistic wellness.</b></div><div><br></div><div><b>🧠 NLP</b></div><div>Explore language, thinking patterns, beliefs and behaviour for personal development, entrepreneurship, leadership and professional growth.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>🌙 HYPNOTHERAPY</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Use focused attention and subconscious-oriented work to explore deeper patterns and desired change.</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>🧲 JAVANESE MAGNETISM</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Explore traditional magnetism-oriented practices, personal presence and energetic awareness.</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>🌀 MESMERISM</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Explore focused attention, presence, suggestion and magnetism-oriented practices.</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>❤️ EMOTIONAL RELEASE</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Create space to acknowledge, understand and move through emotional experiences.</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>⚡ ENERGY HEALING</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">A holistic wellness experience focused on relaxation, grounding, awareness and inner balance.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>ONE PERSON. MANY LAYERS. ONE JOURNEY.</b><br></span>We explore the mind, subconscious patterns, emotions, presence and holistic wellbeing—helping you understand yourself and create meaningful change.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><br></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "article21-5g",
