          "_name": "article13",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article13\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#edefeb\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n           <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/photo-1495584816685-4bdbf1b5057e.jpeg\" parallax selected>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"card col-md-12 col-lg-{{contentWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>🧠 WHY YOUR SUBCONSCIOUS PATTERNS MATTER</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Here's something important:</b><br><br>You can consciously want to change something—<br><br><b>and still find yourself responding in the same old way.<br></b><br>Why?<br><br>Because our experiences can leave behind <b>learned patterns, beliefs, emotional associations and automatic responses that influence how we think, feel and behave.</b><br><br>Sometimes these patterns support us.<br><br>Sometimes they keep us repeating what we no longer want.<br><br><b>You may hear an inner voice saying:</b><br><br>❌ “I'm not good enough.”<br><br>❌ “I always mess things up.”<br><br>❌ “I can't change.”<br><br>❌ “This is just who I am.”<br><br>And even when you consciously want something different...<br><br><b>the old response can keep showing up.</b><br><br><b>BUT HERE'S WHERE CHANGE CAN BEGIN.</b><br><br>Instead of fighting the pattern,<br><br><b>UNDERSTAND IT.</b><br><br>Instead of judging the emotion,<br><br><b>EXPLORE IT.</b><br><br>Instead of automatically repeating the response,<br><br><b>CREATE A NEW POSSIBILITY.<br></b><br><b>RECOGNIZE → UNDERSTAND → REWIRE → TRANSFORM</b><br><br>Through <b>NLP and Hypnotherapy,</b> we explore thoughts, beliefs, language, learned responses and subconscious-oriented patterns.<br><br>Through <b>Emotional Release</b>, we create space to acknowledge, understand and move through emotional experiences.<br><br>Through <b>Energy Healing and holistic wellness practices,</b> we explore relaxation, grounding, awareness and inner balance.<br><br><b>THE GOAL IS NOT TO CONTROL YOUR MIND.<br>THE GOAL IS TO UNDERSTAND IT.</b><br><br>Because when you become more aware of your patterns,<br>you can begin to create more conscious choices.<br><br><b>That's where meaningful transformation begins.</b><br></p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        Start now\n                        </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
