          "_name": "article21",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article021\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\" checked>\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#9fe870\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>🌱HOW TRANSFORMATION HAPPENS</b></h5>\n                    <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Meaningful transformation doesn't happen by simply forcing yourself to change.</b><div><br></div><div>It begins with becoming aware of what is happening within you—your thoughts, emotions, beliefs, patterns and responses.</div><div><br></div><div>At Praveen World, the journey is about moving from <b>awareness to understanding, from understanding to change, and from change to integration.</b></div><br><div><b>RECOGNIZE → UNDERSTAND → REWIRE → RELEASE → RESTORE → TRANSFORM</b></div><div>Your transformation is not about becoming someone else.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>It is about becoming more aware of yourself—and creating the possibility of responding differently.</b></div></h6>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/rzp/YZQ6QlB\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-success\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            BEGIN YOUR TRANSFORMATION\n                        </a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                        <div><b>🌱 THE JOURNEY FROM AWARENESS TO TRANSFORMATION</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>🧠 1. RECOGNIZE</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Become aware of the thoughts, emotions, beliefs and patterns that influence the way you respond.</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>🔍 2. UNDERSTAND</b></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Explore what may be behind those patterns and how they have shaped your experience.</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>🔄 3. REWIRE</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Use NLP and subconscious-oriented work to explore new perspectives, responses and possibilities.</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>❤️ 4. RELEASE</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Create space to acknowledge, process and move through emotional experiences.</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>⚡ 5. RESTORE</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Support relaxation, grounding, awareness and inner balance through holistic wellness practices.</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>🌱 6. INTEGRATE</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Take your new awareness into everyday life and create meaningful, conscious choices.</span><br></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uIsLTsaZZK",
          "_anchor": "article21-24",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "justify"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>✨</b>WHY CHOOSE PRAVEEN WORLD?&nbsp; &nbsp;<b> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b></h4>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">A DEEPER APPROACH TO PERSONAL TRANSFORMATION</h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">At Praveen World, we believe meaningful change begins with understanding the person—not simply the problem.<br><br>Every individual has a unique combination of thoughts, beliefs, emotions, experiences and patterns.<br><br>That's why we don't believe in a one-size-fits-all approach.<br></p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>WHAT MAKES OUR APPROACH DIFFERENT?</b><br><br>◆ MULTI-DIMENSIONAL<br>We look beyond mindset alone and explore the mind, subconscious patterns, emotions, presence and holistic wellbeing.<br><br>◆ PERSON-CENTRED<br>Your experience, goals and journey are unique. The approach begins with understanding where you are.<br><br>◆ INTEGRATED<br>NLP, Hypnotherapy, Javanese Magnetism, Mesmerism, Emotional Release and Energy Healing offer different pathways for different aspects of your journey.<br><br>◆ EXPERIENTIAL<br>Transformation is not only about learning concepts. It is about experiencing awareness, exploring patterns and creating meaningful change.<br><br>◆ HOLISTIC<br>We recognise that personal wellbeing can involve more than thoughts alone—emotions, inner balance, presence and self-awareness matter too.<br><br>◆ PRACTICAL &amp; MEANINGFUL<br>The intention is to help you take greater awareness into your everyday life.<b><br></b></p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>WE DON'T JUST TALK ABOUT CHANGE.<br>WE CREATE SPACE TO EXPLORE IT.</b><br>Understand your patterns.<br>Explore your emotions.<br>Reconnect with yourself.<br>Create more conscious choices.<br><br><b>REWIRE • RELEASE • TRANSFORM</b><br><br><b>Your journey is unique.<br>Your transformation should be too.<br></b></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
