          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Privacy Policy – Praveenworld.com</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Last Updated: April 1, 2026</h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Praveen World (“Praveen World”, “we”, “us”, or “our”), operated by Praveen Singh, respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you provide to us.\n<br>\n<br>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, protect and disclose personal information when you visit praveenworld.com, contact us, book or purchase our services, or otherwise interact with Praveen World.\n<br>\n<br>Where applicable, we will obtain consent or rely on another lawful basis for processing personal information in accordance with applicable law.\n<br>\n<br><b>1. SCOPE OF THIS POLICY\n</b><br>This Privacy Policy applies to:\n<br>\n<br>praveenworld.com\n<br>Forms and enquiry submissions on our website\n<br>Sessions, programs, courses and workshops offered by Praveen World\n<br>Online and in-person services\n<br>Communication between you and Praveen World\n<br>Third-party platforms used by us to provide or manage our services\n<br>\n<br>This Privacy Policy applies to Praveen World and does not cover separate businesses, websites or services that are not operated as part of Praveen World.\n<br>\n<br><b>2. INFORMATION WE MAY COLLECT\n</b><br>Depending on how you interact with us, we may collect the following information:\n<br>\n<br><b>Personal Information\n</b><br>Full name\n<br>Email address\n<br>Phone number\n<br>City, State or Country\n<br>Information you provide when making an enquiry\n<br>Information necessary to arrange or provide a service\n<br>Booking or session-related information\n<br>\n<br><b>Payment Information\n</b><br>\n<br>Where you purchase a service, payment may be processed through Razorpay, our third-party payment service provider.\n<br>\n<br>We generally do not store your complete payment-card, banking or payment credentials on our own systems. Payment information may be collected and processed by Razorpay in accordance with its own privacy policy, terms and security practices.\n<br>\n<br>Praveen World may receive limited transaction-related information necessary to confirm and manage your payment, booking or purchase.\n<br>\n<br><b>Technical and Usage Information\n</b><br>\n<br>When you visit our website, certain technical information may be collected automatically, which may include:\n<br>\n<br>IP address\n<br>Browser type and version\n<br>Device type\n<br>Operating system\n<br>Pages visited\n<br>Approximate usage information\n<br>Referring website or source\n<br>Cookies and similar technologies\n<br>\n<br><b>3. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION\n</b><br>We may use personal information to:\n<br>\n<br>Respond to enquiries and requests\n<br>Schedule and manage sessions\n<br>Provide purchased services\n<br>Manage registrations and bookings\n<br>Process payments through authorized payment providers\n<br>Communicate service-related information\n<br>Send appointment or session reminders\n<br>Provide customer support\n<br>Improve our website, services and user experience\n<br>Maintain website security\n<br>Prevent fraud, misuse or unauthorized activity\n<br>Comply with applicable legal obligations\n<br>Send educational or promotional communications where appropriate consent has been obtained\n<br>\n<br>We use personal information only for legitimate and relevant purposes connected with our services and operations.\n<br>\n<br><b>4. COOKIES AND TRACKING TECHNOLOGIES\n</b><br>Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to:\n<br>\n<br>Enable essential website functionality\n<br>Remember preferences\n<br>Understand website usage\n<br>Improve website performance\n<br>Analyze traffic and user behaviour\n<br>\n<br>You may manage or disable cookies through your browser settings.\n<br>\n<br>Some website features may not function properly if certain cookies are disabled.\n<br>\n<br>Where third-party analytics or advertising technologies are used, their own privacy policies may also apply.\n<br>\n<br><b>5. COMMUNICATIONS\n</b><br>When you submit your contact details or communicate with us, we may contact you regarding:\n<br>\n<br>Your enquiry\n<br>Bookings and sessions\n<br>Payments\n<br>Service-related information\n<br>Changes or updates relating to a service\n<br>Customer support\n<br>\n<br>Where promotional communications require consent, appropriate consent will be obtained.\n<br>\n<br>You may withdraw your consent for promotional communications or opt out at any time by contacting:\n<br>\n<br>help@praveenworld.com\n<br>\n<br>Where an unsubscribe mechanism is provided, you may also use that mechanism.\n<br>\n<br><b>6. SHARING OF PERSONAL INFORMATION\n</b><br>We do not sell, rent or trade your personal information.\n<br>\n<br>We may share limited personal information with trusted third parties where reasonably necessary to operate our website or provide our services, including:\n<br>\n<br>Website and hosting providers\n<br>Razorpay, our authorized payment service provider\n<br>Booking and scheduling platforms\n<br>Learning or course platforms\n<br>CRM and communication tools\n<br>Email, WhatsApp or messaging service providers\n<br>Webinar or online-session platforms\n<br>Technical and analytics providers\n<br>Professional advisers where necessary\n<br>Government, regulatory or law-enforcement authorities where required by applicable law\n<br>\n<br>Third-party service providers may process personal information according to their own terms, privacy policies and security practices.\n<br>\n<br>We seek to share only the information reasonably necessary for the relevant purpose.\n<br>\n<br><b>7. DATA RETENTION\n</b><br>We retain personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes for which it was collected, including:\n<br>\n<br>Providing and managing services\n<br>Maintaining business and transaction records\n<br>Resolving disputes\n<br>Maintaining security\n<br>Meeting applicable legal, tax, accounting or regulatory requirements\n<br>\n<br>When personal information is no longer reasonably required, we may delete, anonymize or securely dispose of it, subject to applicable legal obligations.\n<br>\n<br><b>8. YOUR PRIVACY RIGHTS\n</b><br>Subject to applicable law, you may have rights regarding your personal information, including the ability to:\n<br>\n<br>Request access to information we hold about you\n<br>Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information\n<br>Request deletion where legally applicable\n<br>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent\n<br>Request information about the processing of your personal data, where such information is required to be provided under applicable law\n<br>Raise a privacy-related grievance\n<br>Exercise other rights available to you under applicable law\n<br>\n<br>To exercise a privacy-related right or raise a concern, contact:\n<br>\n<br>help@praveenworld.com\n<br>\n<br>We may need to verify your identity before processing certain requests.\n<br>\n<br>We will respond to privacy-related requests and grievances within the period required by applicable law.\n<br>\n<br><b>9. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY\n</b><br>Our services are intended for individuals 18 years of age or older.\n<br>\n<br>We do not knowingly seek to collect personal information from individuals under 18 through our services.\n<br>\n<br>If we become aware that personal information relating to a minor has been collected without appropriate authorization, we may take reasonable steps to delete or address such information, subject to applicable law.\n<br>\n<br><b>10. THIRD-PARTY LINKS\n</b><br>Our website may contain links to third-party websites, platforms or services.\n<br>\n<br>These third parties operate independently and may have their own privacy policies and terms.\n<br>\n<br>Praveen World is not responsible for the privacy practices, security, content or policies of third-party websites.\n<br>\n<br>We encourage you to review the privacy policy of any third-party service before providing personal information to it.\n<br>\n<br><b>11. SECURITY\n</b><br>We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect personal information against unauthorized access, misuse, loss, alteration or disclosure.\n<br>\n<br>However, no method of transmission or storage over the internet can be guaranteed to be completely secure.\n<br>\n<br>You acknowledge that internet-based services carry inherent security risks.\n<br>\n<br><b>12. DATA BREACHES AND SECURITY INCIDENTS\n</b><br>If we become aware of a personal-data breach affecting information processed by us and applicable law requires notification, we will take appropriate steps in accordance with applicable legal requirements.\n<br>\n<br>Where required, we may notify affected individuals and/or relevant authorities through appropriate channels.\n<br>\n<br>We will maintain appropriate records and take reasonable steps to contain, assess and address applicable personal-data breaches.\n<br>\n<br><b>13. CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY\n</b><br>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in:\n<br>\n<br>Our services\n<br>Our website\n<br>Technology\n<br>Data-processing practices\n<br>Applicable laws or regulations\n<br>\n<br>The updated version will be published on this page with a revised Last Updated date.\n<br>\n<br>You should review this Privacy Policy periodically.\n<br>\n<br><b>14. CONTACT US\n</b><br>If you have any questions, concerns or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal information, please contact us:\n<br>\n<br>Praveen World\n<br>Email: help@praveenworld.com\n<br>Website: praveenworld.com\n<br>Location: Moradabad, Uttar Pradesh, India</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vshuTlmvtg",
