          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Terms and Conditions – Praveenworld.com</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Effective Date: April 1, 2026</h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Welcome to Praveen World. These Terms and Conditions (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of praveenworld.com and the personal-development, coaching and holistic wellness services offered through the website.\n<br>\n<br>Our services may include NLP (Neuro-Linguistic Programming), Hypnotherapy, Javanese Magnetism, Mesmerism, Emotional Release, Energy Healing, personal-development coaching, workshops and related educational experiences.\n<br>\n<br>By accessing our website, submitting an enquiry, booking a session, purchasing a service, enrolling in a program, or otherwise using our services, you acknowledge that you have read, understood and agreed to these Terms.\n<br>\n<br><b>1. Services Offered</b><br>Praveen World provides personal-development, coaching and holistic wellness services, which may include:\n<br>\n<br>NLP (Neuro-Linguistic Programming)\n<br>Hypnotherapy\n<br>Javanese Magnetism\n<br>Mesmerism\n<br>Emotional Release\n<br>Energy Healing\n<br>Personal-development coaching\n<br>Workshops, courses and educational experiences\n<br>Other related services described on our website or relevant service pages\n<br>\n<br>Services may be provided online, in person, through workshops, courses, sessions, or through third-party platforms used by Praveen World.\n<br>\n<br>The specific services, format, duration, fees and applicable conditions may vary and will be communicated on the relevant service or booking page.\n<br>\n<br><b>2. Eligibility</b><br>Our services are intended for individuals who are 18 years of age or older, unless a particular service expressly states otherwise and appropriate arrangements have been made.\n<br>\n<br>By using our website or purchasing our services, you confirm that:\n<br>\n<br>You are legally capable of entering into an agreement.\n<br>The information you provide is accurate and current.\n<br>You will use our website and services lawfully and responsibly.\n<br>\n<br>We reserve the right to decline or discontinue a service where we reasonably believe that participation is inappropriate, unsafe, unlawful or inconsistent with these Terms.\n<br>\n<br><b>3. Nature of Our Services</b><br>Praveen World provides personal-development, coaching and holistic wellness services intended to support self-awareness, personal exploration, learning, relaxation, wellbeing and personal growth.\n<br>\n<br>Our services are not medical, psychiatric or psychological treatment and are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease, disorder or medical or mental-health condition.\n<br>\n<br>In particular, Praveen World does not represent that NLP, Hypnotherapy, Javanese Magnetism, Mesmerism, Emotional Release or Energy Healing will diagnose, cure or treat a medical or mental-health condition.\n<br>\n<br>Our services are not a substitute for consultation, diagnosis or treatment by a qualified doctor, psychologist, psychiatrist or other appropriately qualified healthcare professional.\n<br>\n<br>If you have a medical, psychiatric or mental-health condition, are taking medication, are receiving professional treatment, or believe that you require clinical care, you should consult an appropriately qualified healthcare professional and determine whether participation in any of our services is appropriate for you.\n<br>\n<br>Participation in our services is voluntary.\n<br>\n<br><b>4. INDIVIDUAL EXPERIENCES AND OUTCOMES</b><br>Individual experiences and outcomes vary from person to person.\n<br>\n<br>Praveen World does not guarantee or promise any particular:\n<br>\n<br>Personal outcome\n<br>Emotional outcome\n<br>Behavioural outcome\n<br>Professional outcome\n<br>Relationship outcome\n<br>Financial outcome\n<br>Health outcome\n<br>Wellness outcome\n<br>Or any other specific result\n<br>\n<br>Any examples, testimonials, case studies, experiences or statements presented on our website represent individual experiences and should not be understood as a guarantee that another person will achieve the same result.\n<br>\n<br><b>5. User Information and Access\n</b><br>When you register for a course, program or session, purchase a service, or submit an enquiry or form, you agree to:\n<br>\n<br>Provide accurate, complete and current information.\n<br>Update information when reasonably necessary.\n<br>Keep your account credentials confidential where an account is provided.\n<br>Not allow unauthorized persons to access paid or restricted content through your account.\n<br>Use the website and services only for lawful purposes.\n<br>\n<br>You are responsible for activity carried out through your account where applicable.\n<br>\n<br>We may suspend or restrict access where we reasonably believe there has been misuse, fraud, unauthorized access or violation of these Terms.\n<br>\n<br><b>6. PAYMENTS, CANCELLATIONS AND NO-REFUND POLICY\n</b><br>Payments for sessions, programs, courses, workshops and other services must be made through the payment methods provided by Praveen World or its authorized payment providers.\n<br>\n<br>All payments made for sessions, programs, courses, workshops and other services are non-refundable once payment has been completed, subject to any rights that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited under applicable law.\n<br>\n<br>By completing a purchase or booking, you acknowledge and agree to this No-Refund Policy.\n<br>\n<br>Fees are not refundable due to:\n<br>\n<br>Change of mind after purchase\n<br>Failure to attend a scheduled session\n<br>Failure to use or complete a course, program or service\n<br>Personal circumstances\n<br>Lack of expected or desired results\n<br>Change in personal goals or preferences\n<br>\n<br>Where applicable, a session may be rescheduled at the discretion of Praveen World and subject to availability and any applicable rescheduling conditions.\n<br>\n<br>No refund or rescheduling is guaranteed unless expressly confirmed by Praveen World in writing.\n<br>\n<br>Nothing in this No-Refund Policy is intended to exclude or limit any refund, cancellation or other consumer right that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited under applicable law.\n<br>\n<br>Third-party payment providers may apply their own terms and conditions to payment processing.\n<br>\n<br><b>7. COMMUNICATION\n</b><br>When you contact us, submit an enquiry, register for a service or provide your contact information, we may use your information to:\n<br>\n<br>Respond to your enquiry.\n<br>Arrange or manage sessions.\n<br>Provide requested services.\n<br>Send service-related information.\n<br>Communicate changes, cancellations or other information relating to a service.\n<br>\n<br>Where promotional communications require consent, appropriate consent will be obtained.\n<br>\n<br>You may opt out of promotional communications at any time through the available unsubscribe or communication-preference mechanism.\n<br>\n<br>Our handling of personal information is also governed by our Privacy Policy.\n<br>\n<br><b>8. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY\n</b><br>Unless otherwise stated, the website and materials provided by Praveen World, including text, photographs, graphics, videos, audio, logos, designs, course materials, documents, presentations, training materials and other content, are owned by Praveen Singh, Praveen World, or the respective rights holder.\n<br>\n<br>You may access and use such materials only for their intended personal or educational purpose.\n<br>\n<br>You may not, without prior written permission:\n<br>\n<br>Copy or reproduce our materials.\n<br>Modify or adapt our materials.\n<br>Republish or redistribute our materials.\n<br>Sell or commercially exploit our materials.\n<br>Upload our paid or restricted materials to another platform.\n<br>Share paid course or training materials with unauthorized persons.\n<br>Use our name, logo, branding or content in a manner that suggests unauthorized affiliation or endorsement.\n<br>\n<br>All rights not expressly granted are reserved.\n<br>\n<br><b>9. ACCEPTABLE USE\n</b><br>You agree not to use the website or services:\n<br>\n<br>For any unlawful purpose.\n<br>To violate the rights of another person.\n<br>To upload malicious software or harmful material.\n<br>To attempt unauthorized access to our systems.\n<br>To interfere with the operation or security of the website.\n<br>To reverse engineer or attempt to circumvent technical protections.\n<br>To copy, resell or distribute paid content without authorization.\n<br>To impersonate Praveen World, Praveen Singh or another person.\n<br>To use our services for fraudulent, abusive or deceptive purposes.\n<br>\n<br>We may restrict or terminate access where necessary to protect users, our services, our systems or our legal rights.\n<br>\n<br><b>10. THIRD-PARTY WEBSITES AND SERVICES\n</b><br>Our website may contain links to third-party websites, platforms or services, including payment processors, learning platforms, booking tools, communication platforms, social-media platforms or other service providers.\n<br>\n<br>Third-party services operate independently and may have their own terms and privacy policies.\n<br>\n<br>Praveen World is not responsible for the content, availability, security, privacy practices or terms of third-party websites or services.\n<br>\n<br>You should review the relevant third party's terms and privacy policy before using its services.\n<br>\n<br><b>11. WEBSITE AVAILABILITY\n</b><br>We make reasonable efforts to keep our website and services available and functional.\n<br>\n<br>However, we do not guarantee that the website or any particular feature will always be available, uninterrupted, secure or error-free.\n<br>\n<br>Availability may be affected by maintenance, technical problems, internet or telecommunications failures, third-party services, security incidents or circumstances beyond our reasonable control.\n<br>\n<br>We reserve the right to modify, suspend or discontinue any part of the website or any service where reasonably necessary.\n<br>\n<br><b>12. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY\n</b><br>Praveen World aims to provide its services with reasonable care and professionalism.\n<br>\n<br>However, individual experiences and outcomes vary, and we do not guarantee any specific personal, emotional, professional, health, wellness, financial or other outcome.\n<br>\n<br>To the extent permitted by applicable law, Praveen World shall not be liable for losses or damages arising from:\n<br>\n<br>Misuse of our website or services.\n<br>Failure to follow applicable instructions.\n<br>Inaccurate or incomplete information provided by a user.\n<br>Unauthorized access caused by the user's failure to protect account credentials.\n<br>Third-party websites, platforms or services.\n<br>Technical interruptions or failures beyond our reasonable control.\n<br>Events or circumstances that could not reasonably be prevented or controlled.\n<br>\n<br>Nothing in these Terms excludes or limits any liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited under applicable law.\n<br>\n<br><b>13. INDEMNITY\n</b><br>To the extent permitted by applicable law, you agree to indemnify and hold harmless Praveen World, Praveen Singh and their authorized representatives from claims, losses, liabilities, damages, costs or expenses arising from:\n<br>\n<br>Your unlawful or unauthorized use of the website or services.\n<br>Your violation of these Terms.\n<br>Your infringement of another person's rights.\n<br>Your misuse or unauthorized distribution of our content or materials.\n<br>Information or material submitted by you that violates applicable law or third-party rights.\n<br>\n<br>This provision does not apply to the extent that a claim results from our own unlawful conduct or liability that cannot legally be excluded.\n<br>\n<br><b>14. TERMINATION\n</b><br>We may suspend or terminate your access to the website or services where reasonably necessary, including where:\n<br>\n<br>You violate these Terms.\n<br>Fraudulent or abusive behaviour is suspected.\n<br>Unauthorized use or access is detected.\n<br>Your conduct creates a security or legal risk.\n<br>Termination is required by law or by a competent authority.\n<br>Continued access could materially harm our services, users or systems.\n<br>\n<br>Where appropriate and reasonably practicable, we may provide notice before termination.\n<br>\n<br>Termination does not affect rights or obligations that arose before termination.\n<br>\n<br><b>15. CHANGES TO THESE TERMS\n</b><br>We may update these Terms from time to time to reflect changes in our services, website, legal requirements or business practices.\n<br>\n<br>The updated version will be published on this page with a revised effective date.\n<br>\n<br>You should review these Terms periodically.\n<br>\n<br>Your continued use of the website or services after updated Terms become effective constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms to the extent permitted by applicable law.\n<br>\n<br><b>16. GOVERNING LAW AND JURISDICTION\n</b><br>These Terms shall be governed by and interpreted in accordance with the laws of India.\n<br>\n<br>Subject to applicable law, disputes arising out of or relating to these Terms or our services shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the courts having appropriate jurisdiction at Moradabad, Uttar Pradesh, India.\n<br>\n<br><b>17. SEVERABILITY\n</b><br>If any provision of these Terms is found to be invalid, unlawful or unenforceable by a competent authority, that provision shall be interpreted or modified to the minimum extent necessary to make it enforceable, where legally permitted.\n<br>\n<br>The remaining provisions shall continue to remain in effect.\n<br>\n<br><b>18. ENTIRE AGREEMENT\n</b><br>These Terms, together with the applicable Privacy Policy and any service-specific terms, booking conditions or refund policy communicated to you, constitute the agreement governing your use of the relevant website or services, subject to applicable law.\n<br>\n<br>Where a specific service page contains terms that expressly apply to that service, those service-specific terms will apply to the extent of any inconsistency.\n<br>\n<br><b>19. CONTACT US\n</b><br>If you have questions regarding these Terms or our services, please contact us:\n<br>\n<br>Praveen World\n<br>Email: help@praveenworld.com\n<br>Website: praveenworld.com\n<br>\n<br><b>IMPORTANT NOTICE\n</b><br>Praveen World provides personal-development, coaching and holistic wellness experiences.<br><br>These services are not a substitute for professional healthcare and are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any medical or mental-health condition.<br><br>If you have a medical or mental-health condition or require clinical care, please consult an appropriately qualified healthcare professional.<br><br>Individual experiences may vary, and no specific outcome is guaranteed.<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
