          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Refund, Return &amp; Cancellation Policy – Praveenworld.com</b><br></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Last Updated: April 1, 2026</h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">At Praveen World, we provide personal-development coaching, NLP, Hypnotherapy, Javanese Magnetism, Mesmerism, Emotional Release, Energy Healing, workshops, courses and related educational and holistic wellness services.<br><br>This Refund, Return &amp; Cancellation Policy applies to purchases and bookings made through praveenworld.com.<br><br><b>1. NO-REFUND POLICY</b><br><br>All payments made for sessions, programs, courses, workshops and other services offered by Praveen World are non-refundable once payment has been completed, subject to any rights that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited under applicable law.<br><br>By completing a purchase or booking, you acknowledge and agree to this No-Refund Policy.<br><br><b>2. CANCELLATIONS</b><br><br>Once payment has been completed and a booking, session, program, course or service has been confirmed, the payment is non-refundable.<br><br>Cancellation by the customer does not create an entitlement to a refund.<br><br>This applies regardless of the reason for cancellation, including:<br><br>Change of mind<br>Change in personal circumstances<br>Change in personal goals or preferences<br>Failure to attend a scheduled session<br>Failure to use or complete a course or program<br>Personal scheduling conflicts<br>Failure to achieve an expected or desired outcome<br><br><b>3. RESCHEDULING</b><br><br>Where a session-based service permits rescheduling, a request may be considered subject to availability and the applicable service conditions.<br><br>Rescheduling is not guaranteed and does not create a right to a refund.<br><br>Any rescheduling arrangement must be confirmed by Praveen World in writing.<br><br><b>4. NON-ATTENDANCE AND NO-SHOWS</b><br><br>If you do not attend a scheduled session, workshop, appointment or other service without an approved rescheduling arrangement, the payment remains non-refundable.<br><br>Failure to attend does not create an automatic right to reschedule or receive a refund.<br><br><b>5. DIGITAL PRODUCTS, COURSES AND PROGRAMS</b><br><br>Payments for digital products, online courses, downloadable materials, recorded content, training programs or other digital services are non-refundable once payment has been completed or access has been provided, subject to applicable law.<br><br>You are responsible for ensuring that you have reviewed the service description and requirements before purchasing.<br><br><b>6. TECHNICAL ACCESS ISSUES</b><br><br>If you experience a genuine technical problem that prevents you from accessing a paid digital service or course, please contact us at:<br><br>help@praveenworld.com<br><br>We will make reasonable efforts to investigate and resolve genuine technical access issues.<br><br>Technical support or restoration of access does not automatically create a right to a refund.<br><br><b>7. SERVICE OUTCOMES</b><br><br>Payment is for the service, session, course, program or experience provided by Praveen World and not for a guaranteed result.<br><br>Individual experiences and outcomes may vary.<br><br>No refund will be provided solely because a customer does not experience a particular personal, emotional, professional, wellness or other desired outcome.<br><br><b>8. EXCEPTIONS REQUIRED BY LAW</b><br><br>Nothing in this Policy is intended to exclude or limit any refund, cancellation, replacement, remedy or other consumer right that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited under applicable law.<br><br>Where a refund or other remedy is legally required, it will be handled in accordance with the applicable law.<br><br><b>9. THIRD-PARTY PAYMENT PROCESSING</b><br><br>Payments may be processed through Razorpay, our authorized third-party payment service provider.<br><br>Payment processing may be subject to Razorpay's applicable terms, policies and procedures.<br><br>Where a payment-related issue occurs, we may work with the payment provider to investigate and resolve the matter.<br><br><b>10. POLICY UPDATES</b><br><br>We may update this Refund, Return &amp; Cancellation Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our services, business practices or applicable legal requirements.<br><br>The updated version will be published on this page with a revised Last Updated date.<br><br><b>11. CONTACT US</b><br><br>For questions regarding this Refund, Return &amp; Cancellation Policy, please contact:<br><br>Praveen World<br>Email: help@praveenworld.com<br>Website: praveenworld.com<br>Location: Moradabad, Uttar Pradesh, India</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vshrt7YkBZ",
          "_anchor": "article12-5m",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
